@startuml
scale 1400 width
  [*] --> Configure
  Configure : Waiting for /api/game/start
  Configure --> AwaitStart : EVT_GAME_API_START
  Configure --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  AwaitStart : Arming pin is inserted
  AwaitStart : Light is off
  AwaitStart : "rEdY" is displayed
  AwaitStart --> AwaitArming : Remove arming pin (standby timer starts)
  AwaitStart --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  AwaitArming : Light is on and breathing
  AwaitArming : "----" is displayed
  AwaitArming --> Arming: Insert arming pin
  AwaitArming --> DefenseWin : Standby timer expires
  AwaitArming --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  Arming: Timer displayed and counts down 10 seconds
  Arming: Rapid beeping
  Arming --> Armed : 10 seconds expired
  Arming --> AwaitArming : Arming pin removed prematurely
  Arming --> DefenseWin : Standby timer expires
  Arming --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  Armed: Countdown time is displayed and strobing
  Armed: Constant tone sounding
  Armed --> Countdown : Arming pin removed
  Armed --> DefenseWin : Standby timer expires
  Armed --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  Countdown : Timer counts down
  Countdown : Audio chirps every second
  Countdown --> Disarming : Arming pin is inserted
  Countdown --> OffenseWin : Game timer expires
  Countdown --> OffenseWin : Standby timer expires
  Countdown --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  Disarming: 10 second countdown displayed
  Disarming: Constant tone
  Disarming: Light is strobing
  Disarming --> Disarmed : 10 second expires
  Disarming --> Countdown : Arming pin removed prematurely
  Disarming --> OffenseWin : Standby timer expires
  Disarming --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  Disarmed: Light is off
  Disarmed: "good" is displayed
  Disarmed --> GameOver : Arming pin is removed (single arming)
  Disarmed --> AwaitArming : Arming pin is removed (multiple armings)
  Disarmed --> DefenseWin : Standby timer expires
  Disarmed --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  OffenseWin : Light is off
  OffenseWin : "dEAd" is displayed
  OffenseWin --> GameOver : Arming pin is removed
  OffenseWin --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  DefenseWin : Light is off
  DefenseWin : "SAFE" is displayed
  DefenseWin --> GameOver : Arming pin is removed
  DefenseWin --> LowBattery : Battery is low

  LowBattery : "bAtt" is displayed
  LowBattery : Light is off
  LowBattery : Quick tone chirps

  GameOver : Awaiting reset
  GameOver : "DonE" is displayed
  GameOver : Light is off
  GameOver --> AwaitStart: Arming pin is inserted and removed 2x quickly
  GameOver --> LowBattery : Battery is low
@enduml